id: genetic-focus-shadow-dragon
name: Genetic Focus: Shadow Dragon
order: 16
category: body
# "[Uncanny Monster]": it replaces that Primary Racial Trait - which, the table's. (1) Its Prerequisite, the Shadow Dragon Genes Factor
# Trait, shown and never enforced.
importance: primary
# (2) A Bestial Trait, chosen as it is gained - in the Other Traits list, gone with it.
grantsOther: bestial
# Its own description was given cut short ("T"): asked for.
text: >
  Genetic Focus: Shadow Dragon (Body) [Uncanny Monster]:
  (1)-[Prerequisite]: Shadow Dragon Genes Factor Trait
  (2)-[Passive]: Gain 1 Bestial Trait.
  (3)-[Passive]: Increase your Soak Value and Defense Value by 1(T) against Attacking Maneuvers made by Opponents with the Impaired Combat Condition.
  (4)-[Passive]: You gain access to the Unify Maneuver, but your Race is considered to be Shadow Dragon for the effects of the Unify Maneuver. If a target is in their Ball Form and is Defeated, they do not need to be willing for the effects of the Unify Maneuver.
---

[passive]
# (3) Draconic Physique (2)'s words: an Impaired Opponent's attack - your Soak, and the Defense Value under your Dodge (chat.mjs draconicParts).
allow draconic.vsImpaired;
# (4) The Unify Special Maneuver, your Race a Shadow Dragon's for it; a Defeated target - in their Ball Form - not asked whether willing
# (chat.mjs unifyRefusal, unifyWilling).
allow maneuver.unify;
allow unify.asShadowDragon;
